Z||000000||Raydar||04-11-2001||12:23 PM||||Monday, just after I pulled out of the parking garage at work (Ga Power Co.), and was about to get on I-75/85, I looked in my mirror and saw a <I>clean</I> looking gold fastback GT. Gave him a thumbs up. I was in my Sonoma, so he just looked at me. As I turned toward the X-way, he continued up Highland Ave. This is the second unidentified fastback GT in this neighborhood in as many months. <BR>Belong to anyone here? <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 04-11-2001).]||||reg||14
